-- ============================================================================
-- DR9 PROFESSIONAL DEEP SEED: Perforation & Sand Control, intermediate tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed.
--
-- What this tier owns: what a skin is and what it is not, the four Karakas and
-- Tariq components, reading a nine gun catalog at one fixed rock, turning a
-- skin into a productivity ratio, and where the correlation stops.
--
-- THE RESULT THE TIER IS BUILT ON: the absolute permeability CANCELS. It
-- appears nowhere in any of the four components, because a dimensionless skin
-- compares the actual flow geometry against an ideal radial one and both scale
-- with permeability identically. What the correlation reads instead are two
-- RATIOS, an anisotropy and a crush contrast, which change the SHAPE of the
-- flow field. A gun that is good in one rock is good in another rock of the
-- same anisotropy, and the perforation design therefore needs no permeability
-- at all. The whole course has exactly one input in millidarcies and it feeds
-- one output, the underbalance band, which is a transient flushing question.
--
-- THE SIGN, WHICH IS WHERE THE TIER EARNS ITS KEEP. A negative perforation
-- skin is not an accounting artefact. A tunnel a third of a metre long is a
-- finger of high conductivity reaching into rock an open hole of the same
-- radius never touches, so the effective wellbore radius is genuinely larger
-- than the drilled one and the completion really does flow better than the
-- reference. What a negative skin does NOT tell you is whether the well is
-- damaged: a perforation contribution of minus two under a drilling damage of
-- plus six tests as plus four, and only one of those two terms is computed here.
--
-- WHAT THE TIER REFUSES. A well test measures the SUM of every near-wellbore
-- effect and cannot separate them. This tier computes ONE term of that sum from
-- geometry. It does not predict a well test and it does not explain one, and
-- the lessons say so rather than leaving the reader to assume otherwise.
--
-- ONE CATALOG ROW LEAVES THE CORRELATION'S DEVELOPMENT RANGE, and it is the
-- best looking row in the table. A tier that reported it without the warning
-- would be recommending the one gun whose number it is least entitled to.
-- ============================================================================

